{
  "name": "WashFlow - WhatsApp pesanan siap diambil",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WashFlow: notifikasi WhatsApp saat pesanan siap\n\n**Sebelum menyalakan:**\n1. Buka node **Config** dan isi semua nilai bertanda GANTI.\n2. Buat 2 credential (lihat README): *Supabase API* (memakai service_role key) dan *Bearer Auth* (token WhatsApp Cloud API).\n3. Pasang credential itu di node **Ambil antrean**, **Kirim WhatsApp**, **Tandai terkirim**, **Tandai gagal**.\n4. Uji dengan **Execute workflow** memakai nomor uji Meta, baru **Active**.\n\nAlur: cek antrean tiap menit, kirim template, lapor hasil ke database. Pengiriman ulang dan batas percobaan diatur oleh database.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "name": "Petunjuk",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Tiap 1 menit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c0",
              "name": "supabaseUrl",
              "value": "https://GANTI-PROJECT-ID.supabase.co",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "name": "appUrl",
              "value": "https://GANTI-DOMAIN-APLIKASI-ANDA.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "name": "phoneNumberId",
              "value": "GANTI_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3",
              "name": "templateName",
              "value": "pesanan_siap_diambil",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c4",
              "name": "templateLang",
              "value": "id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c5",
              "name": "waApiVersion",
              "value": "v21.0",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c6",
              "name": "waBaseUrl",
              "value": "https://graph.facebook.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c7",
              "name": "batchSize",
              "value": 10,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.supabaseUrl.replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/rest/v1/rpc/claim_notifications",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { p_limit: $('Config').first().json.batchSize } }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        },
        "nodeCredentialType": "supabaseApi"
      },
      "name": "Ambil antrean",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        140
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "WashFlow Supabase"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// Menyusun isi template WhatsApp dari satu notifikasi. Tidak ada pemanggilan jaringan di sini.\nconst c = $('Config').first().json;\nconst n = $input.item.json;\nconst satu = (t) => String(t ?? '').replace(/[\\r\\n\\t]+/g, ' ').replace(/ {2,}/g, ' ').trim();   // WhatsApp menolak baris baru di parameter template\nconst rupiah = (x) => 'Rp ' + String(Math.round(Number(x))).replace(/\\B(?=(\\d{3})+(?!\\d))/g, '.');\n\nconst nama = satu(n.customer_first_name || 'Pelanggan').slice(0, 40);\nconst info = Number(n.sisa) > 0 ? 'Sisa tagihan ' + rupiah(n.sisa) + '.' : 'Pesanan sudah lunas.';\nconst url = String(c.appUrl).replace(/\\/+$/, '') + '/track/' + n.track_token;\n\n// Urutan parameter HARUS sama dengan variabel {{1}}..{{5}} pada template di Meta (lihat README).\nconst params = [nama, n.order_code, satu(n.branch_name), info, url].map((text) => ({ type: 'text', text }));\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    notification_id: n.notification_id,\n    order_code: n.order_code,\n    wa: {\n      messaging_product: 'whatsapp',\n      to: n.phone,\n      type: 'template',\n      template: { name: c.templateName, language: { code: c.templateLang }, components: [{ type: 'body', parameters: params }] },\n    },\n  },\n};\n"
      },
      "name": "Build message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        880,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.waBaseUrl }}/{{ $('Config').first().json.waApiVersion }}/{{ $('Config').first().json.phoneNumberId }}/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ $json.wa }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        },
        "genericAuthType": "httpBearerAuth"
      },
      "name": "Kirim WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        140
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpBearerAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "WhatsApp Cloud API token"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.supabaseUrl.replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/rest/v1/rpc/complete_notification",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { p_id: $('Build message').item.json.notification_id, p_ok: true, p_wa_message_id: $json.messages?.[0]?.id ?? null } }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        },
        "nodeCredentialType": "supabaseApi"
      },
      "name": "Tandai terkirim",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        40
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "WashFlow Supabase"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// Menentukan apakah kegagalan perlu dicoba ulang.\n// 131026 = nomor bukan pengguna WhatsApp / tidak dapat dikirimi, 131030 = nomor tidak ada di daftar penerima uji (mode sandbox),\n// 132000 / 132001 / 132012 = template tidak cocok dengan kiriman (jumlah variabel, nama, atau format).\n// Semuanya tidak akan berhasil jika diulang, jadi langsung ditandai gagal. Yang lain dicoba ulang oleh database (maks 3 kali).\nconst src = $('Build message').item.json;\nconst raw = JSON.stringify($json.error ?? $json);\nconst permanent = /131026|131030|132000|132001|132012/.test(raw);\nconst msg = String($json.error?.description ?? $json.error?.message ?? raw).slice(0, 400);\nreturn { json: { notification_id: src.notification_id, error: msg, retry: !permanent } };\n"
      },
      "name": "Klasifikasi error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.supabaseUrl.replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/rest/v1/rpc/complete_notification",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { p_id: $json.notification_id, p_ok: false, p_error: $json.error, p_retry: $json.retry } }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        },
        "nodeCredentialType": "supabaseApi"
      },
      "name": "Tandai gagal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1560,
        260
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "WashFlow Supabase"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
